#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Concluding remarks"
msgstr "Mga pangwakas na puna"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Within the query model, Grover's algorithm is *asymptotically optimal*.\n"
"What this means is that it's not possible to come up with a query algorithm for solving the *Search* problem,\n"
"or even the *Unique search* problem specifically, that uses asymptotically less than $O(\\sqrt{N})$ queries in the worst case.\n"
"This is something that has been proved rigorously in multiple ways.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa loob ng query model, ang Grover's algorithm ay *asymptotically optimal*.\n"
"Ang ibig sabihin nito ay hindi posible na makagawa ng isang query algorithm para sa paglutas ng problemang *Search*,\n"
"o kahit ang problemang *Unique search* nang partikular, na gumagamit ng asymptotically na mas mababa sa $O(\\sqrt{N})$ na mga query sa pinakamasamang kaso.\n"
"Ito ay isang bagay na masusing napatunayan sa maraming paraan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Interestingly, this was known even before Grover's algorithm was discovered — Grover's algorithm matched an already-known lower bound.\n"
msgstr "Kapansin-pansin, alam na ito bago pa man natuklasan ang Grover's algorithm — itinugma ng Grover's algorithm ang isang lower bound na kilala na noon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Grover's algorithm is also broadly applicable, in the sense that the square-root speed-up that it offers can be obtained in a variety of different settings.\n"
"For example, sometimes it's possible to use Grover's algorithm in conjunction with another algorithm to get an improvement.\n"
"Grover's algorithm is also quite commonly used as a subroutine inside of other quantum algorithms to obtain speed-ups.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Grover's algorithm ay malawak din ang aplikasyon, sa kahulugang ang square-root speed-up na inaalok nito ay makukuha sa iba't ibang mga sitwasyon.\n"
"Halimbawa, minsan posible na gamitin ang Grover's algorithm kasama ng ibang algorithm para makakuha ng pagpapabuti.\n"
"Ang Grover's algorithm ay kadalasang ginagamit din bilang subroutine sa loob ng ibang mga quantum algorithm para makakuha ng mga speed-up.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, the technique used in Grover's algorithm, where two reflections are composed and iterated to rotate a quantum state vector, can be generalized.\n"
"An example is a technique known as *amplitude amplification*, where a process similar to Grover's algorithm can be applied to another quantum algorithm to boost its success probability quadratically faster than what is possible classically.\n"
"Amplitude amplification has broad applications in quantum algorithms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Panghuli, ang teknik na ginamit sa Grover's algorithm, kung saan dalawang reflection ang pinagsama at inulit para mag-rotate ng quantum state vector, ay maaaring gawing mas pangkalahatan.\n"
"Isang halimbawa ay ang teknik na kilala bilang *amplitude amplification*, kung saan ang proseso na katulad ng Grover's algorithm ay maaaring ilapat sa ibang quantum algorithm para mapalakas ang probability ng tagumpay nito nang quadratically na mas mabilis kaysa sa posible sa klasikong paraan.\n"
"Ang amplitude amplification ay may malawak na mga aplikasyon sa mga quantum algorithm.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "So, although Grover's algorithm may not lead to a practical quantum advantage for searching any time soon, it is a fundamentally important quantum algorithm, and it is representative of a more general technique that finds many applications in quantum algorithms.\n"
msgstr "Kaya, kahit ang Grover's algorithm ay maaaring hindi humantong sa isang praktikal na quantum advantage para sa paghahanap sa malapit na hinaharap, ito ay isang pundamental na mahalagang quantum algorithm, at kinakatawan nito ang isang mas pangkalahatang teknik na may maraming aplikasyon sa mga quantum algorithm.\n"
